      "side": 1,
      "message": "is_loopback() accepts all of 127.0.0.0/8 (e.g. 127.0.0.2), whereas gRPC\u0027s LocalServerCredentials(LOCAL_TCP) checks INADDR_LOOPBACK and only accepts 127.0.0.1 (plus ::1 and ::ffff:127.0.0.1), failing the handshake on any other 127.x.y.z address. grpc_addr_is_loopback() matches gRPC\u0027s check so addresses like 127.0.0.2 are rejected at config commit time rather than failing RPCs at runtime.",
      "parentUuid": "593f5505_7b06f984",
